multiflexi-web (2.3.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Public image endpoints for Node-RED identity icons: companylogo.php,
    credentialimage.php, and appimage.php no longer require a session
    (logos are not sensitive; consumed by node-red-contrib-multiflexi).

  * Job artifact "Rendered" tab and the app run console are no longer blocked by
    frame protection (same-origin framing is allowed)
  * Job history no longer embeds the company logo into every row, which exhausted
    memory on the run template page for companies with a large logo
  * Saving the RunTemplate configuration no longer erases stored secret (password)
    values that were left empty in the form
 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Fri, 30 Oct 2026 14:12:41 +0100

